sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Server as Game Service
    participant Hydra
    participant Kratos

    Client->>Server: GET /auth/logout
    Note over Server: Destroy server-side session
    Server-->>Client: Clear session cookie and redirect to Hydra end-session endpoint
    Client->>Hydra: End-session request
    Hydra->>Kratos: Clear identity provider session
    Hydra-->>Client: Redirect to login screen
